{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show feels like a useful next addition because Alexa fits my Fire TV setup, and its screen gives me a reason to choose it over a voice-only speaker.",
    "The Fire HD 10 fits my interest in watching video while adding portability; its larger Full HD screen makes it more appealing to me than the smaller tablet."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The streaming sticks repeat something I already have through my Fire TV Stick 4K and Fire TV television; an HD stick or themed remote cover gives me little reason to buy another.",
    "The earbuds do not address my current interest in home viewing and security equipment, and several Alexa speakers feel less useful today than the display I would choose."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning Fire TV devices seems to have been taken as a reason to recommend more streaming devices, even when they add little capability.",
    "My interest in connected home equipment seems to have led to too many similar Alexa speakers, although compatibility alone does not create a need for each one."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I already own matters: I am more interested in an addition with a distinct use than another device that repeats an existing function.",
    "The screen and intended use matter to my choices: I prefer the Echo Show for its display and the larger Full HD tablet for portable video, while my repeated interest in cameras also deserves attention."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in connected home entertainment but gave too much weight to familiar devices and too little to what would add a useful new function."
}"}
